# Tech stack

- **Runtime UI:** React 18 + TypeScript
- **Bundler:** Vite 6 (`npm run dev` / `npm run build`)
- **Icons:** lucide-react
- **Styling:** plain CSS in `src/styles.css` (no Tailwind, no component library)
- **Entry:** `src/main.tsx` → `src/App.tsx` (monolithic landing page)
- **Fonts:** Google Fonts Inter (candidate for replacement in UI overhaul)
- **Backend:** none; waitlist is client-side only
- **Hosting:** static `dist/`; Vercel homepage URL configured on GitHub
